===Etymology 2===
From {{der|en|enm|-}} {{m|enm|bottle}}, {{m|enm|botel}}, {{m|enm|buttle}}, from {{der|en|ang|botl||building, house}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*bōþl}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|-}} {{m|gem-pro|*budlą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*buþlą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*bōþlą||house, dwelling, farm}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰōw-|lit=to swell, grow, thrive, be, live, dwell}}.

Cognate with {{cog|frr|budel}}, {{m|frr|bodel}}, {{m|frr|bol}}, {{m|frr|boel||dwelling, inheritable property}}, {{cog|nl|boedel}}, {{m|nl|boel||inheritance, estate}}, {{cog|da|bol||farm}}, {{cog|is|ból||dwelling, abode, farm, lair}}. Related to {{cog|ang|bytlan||to build}}. More at {{l|en|build}}.

